      "label": "H2: “Meet our development team”",
      "group": "Meet our development team",
      "value": "Meet our<br><span class=\"text-gradient-oox\"> development team</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “We are a game development team focused on building, testing…”",
      "group": "Meet our development team",
      "value": "We are a game development team focused on building, testing, and improving mobile games and applications. Our team combines design, engineering, and art to turn ideas into working products."
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “At OOX, we don’t separate thinking from execution. From ear…”",
      "group": "Meet our development team",
      "value": "At OOX, we don’t separate thinking from execution. From early game prototyping to full production, our team works together to validate ideas, reduce risk, and deliver real results."
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “We believe that strong teams build better products. That’s …”",
      "group": "Meet our development team",
      "value": "We believe that strong teams build better products. That’s why our game development company team is structured around collaboration, speed, and clear decision-making."
    },
